{
  "schema": "sawblade.preset",
  "version": 1,
  "name": "D-Beat Crust",
  "category": "Hardcore / Crust",
  "notes": "D-beat crust: less low end, cutting upper mids, tight bottom (Anti Cimex, Disfear, Wolfbrigade). Presence up and a little lower in frequency. Pair with a plexi-style amp (tone 76884). Single path, no captures: renders from files in this repo only (the shared cab is the repo identity IR, a stand-in for a real cab). Starting hypotheses, not a tuned tone.",
